@* Debug-only echo of a control's current bound value -- the same block used to be copy-pasted
   verbatim into every scalar/list control in the library. Sibling of ReadOnlyValue/
   FieldValidationDisplay: reads the cascaded FormOptions itself, so a caller just supplies the text
   to show while the debug flag is off. *@
@if (FormOptions != null && FormOptions.ShowBoundValues)
{
    <div class="bound-value">@Text</div>
}
